          "year": 1991,
          "date_decided": "1991-11-04",
          "holding": "The court held that the district attorney is not authorized to prosecute dependency and neglect proceedings under article 3, and remanded with directions to order the recusal of the district attorney's office, which was simultaneously prosecuting the related criminal case.",
